                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "One of those childhood PopCap games that I played for a total of 8 minutes and never played again. I can see why, but if you're a fan if these difficult brick-busting games, this will give you a good run for your money. \n\nGameplay is addicting, if you're up to the challenge. Other than that, the effects and animations are insanely flashy and takes away from the visual clarity for me.  \n\nGood for a quick 10 minutes of insanity",
